  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Component of the &apos;EU TCX Market Creation Facility&apos; Proposed Investment Programme (PIP) - West Africa envelope</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Action is to support financial system development in particular in promoting local currency finance in line with the EFSD regulation and the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) by enabling TCX to create its market expansion and to promote its currency risk and interest rate risk protection to its clients such as lenders, donors and developers as well as local financial institutions to a larger extent at less cost for them.The specific objective of the Action is to enable the implementation of the EFSD Guarantee Agreements provided for by the EU TCX Market Creation Facility and to enhance its impact in Sub-Saharan Africa (SSA).</narrative>
  </description>
